  "outline": [
    "Read the question: ln y against x is a straight line; the model is y = A e to the minus n x (write model).",
    "Take ln of both sides: ln y = -n x + ln A — this is Y = mX + c (write Y, mX, c).",
    "So the gradient is minus n and the intercept is ln A (underline mX and c).",
    "Gradient from the two points: (7-3)/(4-2) = 2 (write grad, m2).",
    "Substitute (2, 3) to find c = -1 (write sub, c1).",
    "Trap: the gradient is MINUS n, so n = -2 (write n).",
    "Un-log the intercept: ln A = -1, so A = e to the minus 1, about 0.368 (write A, box both)."
  ]
